flowchart TD
    A[User message] --> B{Gift consultation with constraints?}
    B -- No --> C[Baseline chatbot: general answer]
    B -- Yes --> D[Extract and update recipient profile]
    D --> E{Required profile complete?}
    E -- No --> F[Ask exactly one priority follow-up]
    F --> D
    E -- Yes --> G[search_gifts: offline catalog]
    G --> H{Any matches?}
    H -- No --> I[Safe fallback: suggest relaxing one constraint]
    H -- Yes --> J[rank_gifts and explain 3-5 choices]
